# Project-specific variables. Copy to deploy/vars.extra.catalog in your app repo; the
# wizard reads it after vars.catalog (same format: KEY|kind|group|default|help|options).
# Every NEXT_PUBLIC_* key is passed to the frontend build automatically.

CAPTCHA_DRIVER|required|core|svg|Captcha driver
NEXT_PUBLIC_ENABLE_DIAGNOSTICS|required|core|false|Show diagnostics page in the frontend
APP_MAINTENANCE_DRIVER|required|core|file|Maintenance mode driver

# A select with its own groups:
# SEARCH_DRIVER|select|search|database|Search engine|database meilisearch
# MEILISEARCH_HOST|optional|search-meilisearch|http://127.0.0.1:7700|Meilisearch URL
# MEILISEARCH_KEY|secret|search-meilisearch||Meilisearch key
